  "description": "OFURIS crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H115 Dy5 N8 O25,5(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.569-5.100 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.83-159.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5(OH)5(L-Trp)4(Ph2acac)6]·5CH2Cl2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 5 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
